    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:27:13",
      "sequence": 18165,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 27",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "ISA",
        "chapter": 27,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 27,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "It will happen in that day that a great trumpet will be blown; and those who were ready to perish in the land of Assyria, and those who were outcasts in the land of Egypt, shall come; and they will worship the LORD in the holy mountain at Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "그 날에 큰 나팔을 울려 불리니 앗수르 땅에서 파멸케 된 자와 애굽 땅으로 쫓겨난 자가 돌아와서 예루살렘 성산에서 여호와께 경배하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "4dc3e34354a898d6ad115c6e729dfad5a4ecc86220825aa2ad13e0c8986286ee",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ebc684084aa73e40811cd49cb63c6d4e68b60a86f7c77164388d5b33fa35e9f",
